  "summary": "古说以天同田宅聚财邻水，作者则强调宫位意识型态不能代替实际房屋方位。盘十三坐西朝东对应酉，天同得禄存和巨门禄转旺，地势可能高；盘十四庚天同忌同羊转弱，同向房屋可能低洼漏水。属来源方位推断，不以古引文直接保证环境。",
  "summary_en": "The classical verse associates Tian Tong in Property with savings and nearby water. The author instead distinguishes palace attitudes from actual house orientation. In Chart Thirteen, a west-seated, east-facing house corresponds to You; Lu Cun and Ju Men Hua Lu strengthen Tian Tong, suggesting higher ground. In Chart Fourteen, Geng Tian Tong Hua Ji with Qing Yang weakens the placement, suggesting lower terrain and possible water problems for the same orientation. These are qualified source interpretations, not guaranteed environmental findings.",
